{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星陳妍希去年憑內地劇集《狙擊蝴蝶》人氣翻升，節目邀約和品牌代言接連不斷，昨日（13日）她便現身江蘇，參與音樂節目《打歌2026．X舞台》的錄製，一展歌喉。</p><p>陳妍希身穿一襲露肩長裙亮相，裙身鋪滿鮮艷的紅色花瓣，相當搶眼。</p><p>她與說唱歌手早安組</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.871294+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T16:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_hash":"7b0dace329fe5d9068e821f42b6eef6338b4a72d3a98ed433ba0d3db4a9a5a2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}